    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand</strong> your base in <strong>Nigredo</strong>, a management and strategy game set in a world shaped by science and alchemy. Build more rooms, assign and recruit workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have<i>\u00a0</i>to maintain balance between two opposing forces \u2014 <strong>Nigredo</strong>, the energy of decay and transformation, and <strong>Albedo</strong>, the drive for purity and progress. As your population shifts with time, adapt your systems to ensure continuous growth and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage and Expand</strong> \u2013 Construct facilities and assign workers to key roles across your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Optimize workflows, balance production chains, and plan upgrades to sustain long-term development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Progression System</strong> \u2013 Research new base upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand. Discover. Transform.</strong><br><i>Nigredo</i> invites you to grow a society where change is the only constant.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand</strong> your base in <strong>Nigredo</strong>, a management and strategy game set in a world shaped by science and alchemy. Build more rooms, assign and recruit workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have<i>\u00a0</i>to maintain balance between two opposing forces \u2014 <strong>Nigredo</strong>, the energy of decay and transformation, and <strong>Albedo</strong>, the drive for purity and progress. As your population shifts with time, adapt your systems to ensure continuous growth and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage and Expand</strong> \u2013 Construct facilities and assign workers to key roles across your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Optimize workflows, balance production chains, and plan upgrades to sustain long-term development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Progression System</strong> \u2013 Research new base upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand. Discover. Transform.</strong><br><i>Nigredo</i> invites you to grow a society where change is the only constant.</p>",
    "short_description": "Expand your base by building new rooms, recruiting workers, and assigning them to key workstations. Can your society overcome the forces of Nigredo? Time is of the essence.",
